{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":38,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":38,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677c6f4429d1fd72f79f2","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你已经知道该怎么做，只是“说起来容易”——因为那个骂自己的声音跟了你太多年，不是一句话就能请走的。能先听出它在骂你，就已经是变化了。你觉得那个声音，最常在什么时候冒出来？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你已经知道该怎么做，只是“说起来容易”——因为那个骂自己的声音跟了你太多年，不是一句话就能请走的。能先听出它在骂你，就已经是变化了。你觉得那个声音，最常在什么时候冒出来？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1862,"promptTokens":2629,"completionTokens":104,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:54"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":39,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01406230386784528,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af677c6f4429d1fd72f79f1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537414114,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677c6f4429d1fd72f79f1","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（停顿）我没想过……可能，就是别再骂自己了吧。累了就说累，别老觉得是自己不够好。可这说起来容易。<第19轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":38,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01406230386784528,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af677c6f4429d1fd72f79f2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537414111,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677c0f4429d1fd72f79e9","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"那句“累”，你说得小声，可我听得很清楚——能说出口，已经不容易了。只是你马上又用“日子还得过”把它推开了，好像知道自己累，也改变不了什么。我想问问，如果这份累被认真对待一次，你希望它被怎么对待？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"那句“累”，你说得小声，可我听得很清楚——能说出口，已经不容易了。只是你马上又用“日子还得过”把它推开了，好像知道自己累，也改变不了什么。我想问问，如果这份累被认真对待一次，你希望它被怎么对待？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2471,"promptTokens":3338,"completionTokens":165,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:48"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":37,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.015901142644334017,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af677c0f4429d1fd72f79e8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537408460,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677c0f4429d1fd72f79e8","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（小声）累。……说出来还挺不习惯的。可是，就算知道自己累，又能怎么样呢？日子不还得照样过。<第18轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":nul