不累。那你自己呢，有没有在什么时候，问过自己这一句？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2150,"promptTokens":3358,"completionTokens":125,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:33"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":33,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005219417943184161,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af677b1f4429d1fd72f79d4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537393850,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677b1f4429d1fd72f79d4","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（想了想）可能是……“你累不累？”吧。就这一句，我就觉得，有人真的看见我了。<第16轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":32,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005219417943184161,"emotions":[{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":7,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":5,"sort":1},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":3,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":3,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":0,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":0,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":0,"sort":9}],"relationId":"6af677b1f4429d1fd72f79d5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537393847,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677aaf4429d1fd72f79ca","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"那个一直等着被问一句的小孩，等了很多年，也没等到谁。刚才你替她把那份酸说出来了——这本身就像有人终于来问了一声。如果现在真有人问那一句，你最希望他问的是什么？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"那个一直等着被问一句的小孩，等了很多年，也没等到谁。刚才你替她把那份酸说出来了——这本身就像有人终于来问了一声。如果现在真有人问那一句，你最希望他问的是什么？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2193,"promptTokens":3303,"completionTokens":134,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:26"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":31,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012430858886724233,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af677aaf4429d1fd72f79c9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537386240,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:26","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677aaf4429d1fd72f79c9","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（吸了下鼻子）就是……酸酸的，闷在胸口那种。好像小时候那个我，一直等着有人来问一句，可谁也没来。<第15轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":30,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012430858886724233,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":7,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":7,"sort":9},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":3,"sort":2},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":0,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af677aaf4429d1fd72f79ca","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537386237,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:26","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677a3f4429d1fd72f79c2","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你说希望孩子不用拿奖状来换你的喜欢——这句话一出口，你心里难受，我猜是因为那个“不用换也值得被喜欢”的孩子，其实也包括你自己。这份难受，你愿意多停一会儿，跟我说说它像什么吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你说希望孩子不用拿奖状来换你的喜欢——这句话一出口，你心里难受，我猜是因为那个“不用换也值得被喜欢”的孩子，其实也包括你自己。这份难受，你愿意多停一会儿，跟我说说它像什么吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1827,"promptTokens":3301,"completionTokens":91,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:19"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":29,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035933411127556263,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af677a3f4429d1fd72f79c1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537379198,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af677a3f4429d1fd72f79c1","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（声音有点低）我希望他知道，就算他什么也没做，我也喜欢他。就是……不用他拿奖状、拿成绩来换。说到这，我心里有点难受。<第14轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":28,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035933411127556263,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":5,"sort":3},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":4,"sort":2},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":2,"sort":1},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":0,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af677a3f4429d1fd72f79c2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537379195,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6779ef4429d1fd72f79b7","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你怕的不是孩子，是怕自己不知不觉变成那个“不会表达”的妈妈——这个担心本身，就说明你已经跟她不一样了。你愿意说说，你希望孩子从你这里感受到什么吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你怕的不是孩子，是怕自己不知不觉变成那个“不会表达”的妈妈——这个担心本身，就说明你已经跟她不一样了。你愿意说说，你希望孩子从你这里感受到什么吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1883,"promptTokens":2571,"completionTokens":83,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:14"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01590320939456805,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6779ef4429d1fd72f79b6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537374161,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6779ef4429d1fd72f79b6","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（低头）我其实……就希望别人觉得我这个人还行，不用多好。可我一想到孩子，就特别怕，怕我这样下去，也变成我妈那样，对孩子也不会表达。<第13轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":26,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01590320939456805,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":6,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af6779ef4429d1fd72f79b7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537374159,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67798f4429d1fd72f79ad","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"一点也不可笑，听着反而让人心里有点酸。小时候那张奖状被放一边之后，你像是学会了一条规矩：只有“有用”才安全，才值得被看见。可这条规矩里，从来没有“你本身”的位置。如果暂时不谈有用，你希望别人眼里的你是什么样子？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"一点也不可笑，听着反而让人心里有点酸。小时候那张奖状被放一边之后，你像是学会了一条规矩：只有“有用”才安全，才值得被看见。可这条规矩里，从来没有“你本身”的位置。如果暂时不谈有用，你希望别人眼里的你是什么样子？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2126,"promptTokens":3341,"completionTokens":129,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:08"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020329893666380768,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67798f4429d1fd72f79ac","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537368638,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67798f4429d1fd72f79ac","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（沉默了一会儿）……我没想过。好像除了“有用”，我不知道自己还能被怎么看。说出来有点可笑吧。<第12轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020329893666380768,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67798f4429d1fd72f79ad","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537368636,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67793f4429d1fd72f799f","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“做得够好，别人自然会在意我”——这个念头听着懂事，其实挺累的，它把被在乎变成了要一直交作业。而且它很少真的兑现，你已经做得够多了。你有没有想过，如果不用“够好”来换，你希望他们怎么看你？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“做得够好，别人自然会在意我”——这个念头听着懂事，其实挺累的，它把被在乎变成了要一直交作业。而且它很少真的兑现，你已经做得够多了。你有没有想过，如果不用“够好”来换，你希望他们怎么看你？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1946,"promptTokens":3162,"completionTokens":105,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:03"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":23,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.04208002007395712,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67793f4429d1fd72f799e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537363166,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67793f4429d1fd72f799e","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"没有……怎么说得出口啊，好像我在讨要什么似的。而且我总觉得，我要是做得够好，他们自然就会在意我，不用我开口。<第11轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":22,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.04208002007395712,"emotions":[{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":5,"sort":2},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":4,"sort":3},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":4,"sort":6},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af67793f4429d1fd72f799f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537363163,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:36:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6778ff4429d1fd72f7997","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"寄钱这件事，你想要的其实不是回报，而是被惦记、被看见——这不是计较，是一个挺朴素的愿望。你怕自己显得小气，我倒觉得你对自己太苛刻了。那你有没有跟丈夫或谁提过，你其实希望被多惦记一点？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"寄钱这件事，你想要的其实不是回报，而是被惦记、被看见——这不是计较，是一个挺朴素的愿望。你怕自己显得小气，我倒觉得你对自己太苛刻了。那你有没有跟丈夫或谁提过，你其实希望被多惦记一点？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1753,"promptTokens":3056,"completionTokens":115,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:59"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009706366925848657,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6778ff4429d1fd72f7996","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537359152,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6778ff4429d1fd72f7996","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（停顿）……好像是。我给家里寄钱，也是想着这样他们就能多惦记我一点。可有时候又觉得，他们惦记的是钱，不是我。这么说我弟，是不是显得我很计较？<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009706366925848657,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":4,"sort":2},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":2,"sort":5},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af6778ff4429d1fd72f7997","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537359149,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6778af4429d1fd72f7992","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"那张被放在一边的奖状，你记了这么久，说明那一刻真的很失落。慢慢地，好像就变成了“我得有用、得做出点什么，才会被看见”。你有没有发现，现在在家里插不上话时，心里冒出来的也是类似的感觉？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"那张被放在一边的奖状，你记了这么久，说明那一刻真的很失落。慢慢地，好像就变成了“我得有用、得做出点什么，才会被看见”。你有没有发现，现在在家里插不上话时，心里冒出来的也是类似的感觉？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2050,"promptTokens":2921,"completionTokens":122,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:54"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574004067474465,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6778af4429d1fd72f7991","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537354579,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6778af4429d1fd72f7991","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"可能是小时候吧。我记得有一次拿了奖状回家，他们看了一眼就放一边了，说忙。后来我就觉得，得做点“有用”的事，他们才会看我一眼。<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574004067474465,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":7,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":7,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1}],"relationId":"6af6778af4429d1fd72f7992","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537354576,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67786f4429d1fd72f798c","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你能把这些说出来，已经很不容易了。你反复用“矫情”说自己，可我听到的是一个一直在忍、怕给别人添麻烦的人。这种自我怀疑，是从什么时候开始跟着你的？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你能把这些说出来，已经很不容易了。你反复用“矫情”说自己，可我听到的是一个一直在忍、怕给别人添麻烦的人。这种自我怀疑，是从什么时候开始跟着你的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1755,"promptTokens":2349,"completionTokens":92,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:50"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":17,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012429470905189798,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67786f4429d1fd72f798b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537350588,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67786f4429d1fd72f798b","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"跟谁说啊……其实没怎么跟人说。我丈夫也不太聊这些，我怕他觉得我事多。有时候就想，是不是我自己太矫情了。<第8轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":16,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012429470905189798,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67786f4429d1fd72f798c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537350585,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67781f4429d1fd72f7986","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"不乱，我跟得上，你说的这些挺清楚的。你一边说心里堵，一边又替家里说话，这份体谅很不容易。只是体谅别人和照顾自己的感受，其实可以同时存在。你平时有不舒服的时候，一般会跟谁说呢？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"不乱，我跟得上，你说的这些挺清楚的。你一边说心里堵，一边又替家里说话，这份体谅很不容易。只是体谅别人和照顾自己的感受，其实可以同时存在。你平时有不舒服的时候，一般会跟谁说呢？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1950,"promptTokens":2219,"completionTokens":106,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:45"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":15,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005219426643055025,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67781f4429d1fd72f7985","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537345409,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67781f4429d1fd72f7985","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"挺多的吧……不过我也不想说家里太多不好，毕竟他们也不容易。那个，我是不是说得太乱了？<第7轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":14,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005219426643055025,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":5,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":4,"sort":3},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":0,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67781f4429d1fd72f7986","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537345406,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6777df4429d1fd72f7981","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"插不上话的时候，人很容易觉得自己在那一刻是“多余的”，这种在意并不小题大做。你嘴上说没什么，心里却堵着，说明它对你有些分量。那种被晾在一边的感觉，你以前在家里别的场合也遇到过吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"插不上话的时候，人很容易觉得自己在那一刻是“多余的”，这种在意并不小题大做。你嘴上说没什么，心里却堵着，说明它对你有些分量。那种被晾在一边的感觉，你以前在家里别的场合也遇到过吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2390,"promptTokens":2104,"completionTokens":155,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:41"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":13,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909063060552752,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6777df4429d1fd72f7980","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537341694,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6777df4429d1fd72f7980","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"就是吃饭的时候吧……我妈一直在说我弟的事，我插不上话。其实也没什么大不了的，我也不知道自己干嘛这么在意。<第6轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":12,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909063060552752,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":5,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":0,"sort":6}],"relationId":"6af6777df4429d1fd72f7981","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537341691,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67776f4429d1fd72f797e","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你提到“从小就这样”，又特意说到回家之后更堵，我留意到“家”这个环境好像让这种感觉变重了。听起来不是偶然的。在家的这段时间，有没有哪个具体的时刻或场景，让你觉得堵得最厉害？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你提到“从小就这样”，又特意说到回家之后更堵，我留意到“家”这个环境好像让这种感觉变重了。听起来不是偶然的。在家的这段时间，有没有哪个具体的时刻或场景，让你觉得堵得最厉害？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2528,"promptTokens":1865,"completionTokens":189,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:34"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":11,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00857463322828159,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67776f4429d1fd72f797d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537334462,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67776f4429d1fd72f797d","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……好像很久了，从小就这样吧。不过最近更明显一点，就是放假回家之后，心里特别堵。<第5轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":10,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00857463322828159,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af67776f4429d1fd72f797e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537334459,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67770f4429d1fd72f797c","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听得出来，那种“怪怪的”感觉让你挺难受的，又说不清从哪儿来——这其实很常见，情绪有时比原因先到。家里的事你不想细说也没关系，我们可以从感觉本身聊起。这种感觉大概是什么时候开始变得明显的？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"听得出来，那种“怪怪的”感觉让你挺难受的，又说不清从哪儿来——这其实很常见，情绪有时比原因先到。家里的事你不想细说也没关系，我们可以从感觉本身聊起。这种感觉大概是什么时候开始变得明显的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2222,"promptTokens":1862,"completionTokens":176,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:28"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":9,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009703788257353664,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67770f4429d1fd72f797b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537328741,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:35:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67770f4429d1fd72f797b","chatId":"b9413ba7e5884f7893c428899d1ad7de","sessionId":null,"userId":99856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"就是……家里的事，我不太想让认识的人知道。反正就是最近心里挺难受的，也说不上来为什么，就是觉得什么都怪怪的。<第4轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要